# Public mirror allowlist for reya-deployments (Type A snapshot).
#
# One path (file or directory) per line. Anything NOT listed here is NEVER
# published to the public mirror. `.github/` is intentionally excluded so this
# workflow and any internal CI never leak.
#
# TODO(PRO-696): confirm this list is exactly what should be public before
# enabling the workflow. Add/remove as needed.

README.md
package.json
lerna.json
yarn.lock
.yarnrc.yml
.yarn/
.gitignore
.prettierrc
.solhint.json
packages/
